{"chapter":{"blocks":[{"text":"练习","type":"TITLE"},{"text":"本节学习：练习。讲义保留原有示例与练习，可结合正文向教师提问。","type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"text":"1. 用 `tracert` 命令观察到一个网站经过几跳。\n2. 解释为什么 TCP 三次握手不能改成两次。\n3. 写出访问 `www.baidu.com` 时从 DNS 查询到 TCP 连接建立的完整步骤。\n4. 用 Python socket 写一个最简单的 TCP 客户端和服务器。\n5. 解释 HTTPS 比 HTTP 多做了哪三件事。","type":"MARKDOWN"}],"grade_max":12,"grade_min":10,"knowledge_points":[{"description":"学习并解释「练习」中的核心概念与示例。","name":"练习","slug":"senior-network-topic-11","topic":"计算机与人工智能"}],"license_code":"UNKNOWN","objectives":["解释「练习」的主要概念，并结合示例完成文中练习。"],"order_index":22,"revision":1,"slug":"ch-011-main","source":{"conversion":"supplied-markdown-v1","original_sha256":"5415993d7c45ae22ee787bfc1e5407080a497cb48da44988aef9f44dee144ef2","source_commit":null,"source_path":"sources/5415993d7c45ae22/08-计算机网络自顶向下方法.md"},"stage":"SENIOR","title":"练习"},"content_hash":"aa4c1e138dfe3d70f4334b23dd2e59074b070dddc565a0e16ba145c6029e672d","course":{"slug":"senior-network","title":"计算机网络","topic":"计算机与人工智能"},"is_test_fixture":false,"manifest_hash":"b2500e5121455aa9339fe6399902e89a0917eaf9bd814708a6dc69af397b6b20","release_key":"computing-ai-md-v1-db6ffb6b663b","schema_version":"k12.content.revision-snapshot.v1","source_kind":"NEW_SOURCE"}
